# AOSP Device manifest

```
git clone https://github.com/samsungexynos850/local_manifests.git -b lineage-23.2 .repo/local_manifests
```
Then to sync up:
```
repo sync
```

## Galaxy A12 (a12s)

In addition to `a21s.xml`, use `a12s.xml` for SM-A127F:

```
git clone https://github.com/varifocal/local_manifests.git -b lineage-23.2 .repo/local_manifests
# then copy or symlink a12s.xml into .repo/local_manifests/ (or keep both a21s.xml and a12s.xml)
repo sync
```

`a12s.xml` points device/vendor/kernel at varifocal public repos and hardware/slsi at LineageOS.
Kernel revision is `a16-kernel` (work branch). **UNTESTED ON DEVICE.**
